FFmpeg
------
No FFmpeg binary is currently included in this repository. The intended
candidate, provided by the release owner, is the BtbN Windows x86_64 LGPL
shared build `ffmpeg-n9.0.1-9-gfa97c9f046-win64-lgpl-shared-9.0.zip` from:
https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds/releases/tag/autobuild-2026-08-27-16-45
Build repository: https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds
FFmpeg n9.0.1 source tag: https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/tree/n9.0.1

The proposed BtbN release-tag URL currently returns 404 (checked 2026-10-28).
The repository's release page lists an n9.0 LGPL-shared archive under a moving
`latest` URL, which is not an acceptable release input. Do not use that asset;
wait for a valid immutable release URL or a locally supplied archive. For the
selected archive, record its exact version and SHA-256 cross-checked against
that release's checksums.sha256, the `ffmpeg -version` configuration line,
whether `--enable-version3` is present, and the LICENSE text from the archive.
Confirm that neither `--enable-gpl` nor `--enable-nonfree` is present. Bundle
ffmpeg.exe, ffprobe.exe, and all required DLLs. Preserve the verified ZIP in
the ignored local `vendor/release-assets` directory; builds must not download
from a moving URL.
FFmpeg licensing guidance:
https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

