https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint/releases/tag/v1.5.1
Windows x86_64 archive:
https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint/releases/download/v1.5.1/chromaprint-fpcalc-1.5.1-windows-x86_64.zip
Source tag: https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint/tree/v1.5.1
License text: https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint/blob/v1.5.1/LICENSE.md

The archive has not yet been supplied for verification. Before release, record
